{
  "description": "Arbitrum addresses Send recognizes as a USDC destination (destinationType \"usdc\"): 0x and 40 hex digits, all lower case, all upper case, or mixed case matching its EIP-55 checksum; mainnet only. Checksums verified with alloy-primitives. Shared by Android and iOS.",
